      "title": "Brief Posttraumatic Cognitions Inventory (PTCI-9)",
      "description": "A 9-item abbreviation of the PTCI (Wells et al., 2019), three items per subscale: negative cognitions about the self, negative cognitions about the world, and self-blame.",
